WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:03.575
Where motivation is low, that's
 where discipline&nbsp;kicks in.

00:00:04.184 --> 00:00:07.529
Anybody who's done something 
noteworthy with their lives

00:00:07.529 --> 00:00:10.976
all have one thing in common,&nbsp;
and that's discipline.

00:00:11.418 --> 00:00:14.215
I encourage you to just 
write down your goals. 

00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:18.263
Starting off your day with&nbsp;reading 
your goals and dreams aloud

00:00:18.263 --> 00:00:20.029
gives you a boost of positive energy.

00:00:20.762 --> 00:00:25.285
This energy can take you&nbsp;to places 
you couldn't even imagine.

00:00:25.789 --> 00:00:31.660
Now a cheat code to ensure that you're
 staying disciplined&nbsp;to whatever you're striving for

00:00:32.278 --> 00:00:34.380
is to prime your environment for success.

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:38.411
Which brings me to a very important 
step&nbsp;of the Hi Level mindset.

00:00:38.987 --> 00:00:42.600
Remove all negative people out 
of your life immediately.

00:00:42.935 --> 00:00:47.489
If you're&nbsp;talking about your dreams and goals 
and they give small, sarcastic remarks...

00:00:48.212 --> 00:00:49.905
boot them.

00:00:50.695 --> 00:00:54.220
Don’t let&nbsp;someone else’s 
negativity cancel out your light.

